(6089047, 895749, 110400, '<td valign="top">There always seems to be at least one in every challenge who likes to push the line on what the challenge actually means.</td>', 'There always seems to be at least one in every challenge who likes to push the line on what the challenge actually means.', '2010-07-12 03:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089054, 894959, 110400, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done on the composition.  The color seems a little off though.  Maybe a dash too much yellowing in the tone.  Otherwise great. (7)</td>', 'Very nicely done on the composition.  The color seems a little off though.  Maybe a dash too much yellowing in the tone.  Otherwise great. (7)', '2010-07-12 03:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089057, 896181, 110400, '<td valign="top">How does this relate to order?  Probably would have worked well as an HDR shot to pull out the detail in the background if it wasn''t a basic editing challenge.</td>', 'How does this relate to order?  Probably would have worked well as an HDR shot to pull out the detail in the background if it wasn''t a basic editing challenge.', '2010-07-12 03:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089137, 896181, 18207, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The score is, however, lowered because it''s not connected to the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this. The score is, however, lowered because it''s not connected to the theme of the challenge.', '2010-07-12 05:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089140, 895749, 18207, '<td valign="top">While it was a nice scene for sure, I miss the connection to Order. My point is that the connection must be in the photo itself, not in the title. Let the picture speak.</td>', 'While it was a nice scene for sure, I miss the connection to Order. My point is that the connection must be in the photo itself, not in the title. Let the picture speak.', '2010-07-12 06:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089141, 896121, 18207, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, add much to the feeling.</td>', 'I love the colors, add much to the feeling.', '2010-07-12 06:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089143, 895721, 18207, '<td valign="top">What grabs my eyes is the plank, because it''s light. Then, of course, I can see the rhythm of jars. Maybe it can be corrected with a slightly modified POV.</td>', 'What grabs my eyes is the plank, because it''s light. Then, of course, I can see the rhythm of jars. Maybe it can be corrected with a slightly modified POV.', '2010-07-12 06:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089144, 895858, 18207, '<td valign="top">Strange color artifacts, but still, it''s pretty nice.</td>', 'Strange color artifacts, but still, it''s pretty nice.', '2010-07-12 06:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089145, 896134, 18207, '<td valign="top">Let the photo speak instead of he title. This would make a nice environmental portrait.</td>', 'Let the photo speak instead of he title. This would make a nice environmental portrait.', '2010-07-12 06:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089146, 896199, 18207, '<td valign="top">Showing the work of mankind ("order") ruling over the once natural forest ("chaos") is a great point.<br/>What''s the purple color cast?</td>', 'Showing the work of mankind ("order") ruling over the once natural forest ("chaos") is a great point.What''s the purple color cast?', '2010-07-12 06:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089148, 896227, 18207, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt.</td>', 'I like the tilt.', '2010-07-12 06:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089151, 896261, 18207, '<td valign="top">The edges should have had more attention. I mean a more precise crop and some perspective correction. Also, it''s a bit grey, lacks contrast. The idea worths more.</td>', 'The edges should have had more attention. I mean a more precise crop and some perspective correction. Also, it''s a bit grey, lacks contrast. The idea worths more.', '2010-07-12 06:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089152, 895239, 18207, '<td valign="top">A great shot with a bit larger crop than THIS CHALLENGE needs. In other words, a tighter composition would help emphasizing the order of seeds.</td>', 'A great shot with a bit larger crop than THIS CHALLENGE needs. In other words, a tighter composition would help emphasizing the order of seeds.', '2010-07-12 06:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089155, 896136, 18207, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge? :)</td>', 'Wrong challenge? :)', '2010-07-12 06:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089159, 896123, 18207, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s great. During voting (everything in order, not picking from thumbnails) this is the first one that really caught my attention.<br/>I''m a bit unsure about the bottom. It''s a bit much for me but if I cut, say, the half of it, the shape of the frame gets ugly and I start missing it. So, I don''t know.</td>', 'Now, that''s great. During voting (everything in order, not picking from thumbnails) this is the first one that really caught my attention.I''m a bit unsure about the bottom. It''s a bit much for me but if I cut, say, the half of it, the shape of the frame gets ugly and I start missing it. So, I don''t know.', '2010-07-12 06:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6089160, 895494, 18207, '<td valign="top">Arty. Did you try rotating the book?</td>', 'Arty. Did you try rotating the book?', '2010-07-12 06:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
