(6089173, 895891, 18207, '<td valign="top">Please do your (and your camera''s) best to achieve a reasonable level of sharpness and contrast. This one could fly so high.</td>', 'Please do your (and your camera''s) best to achieve a reasonable level of sharpness and contrast. This one could fly so high.', '2010-07-12 06:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
