(6091210, 896191, 112739, '<td valign="top">I hope I am not the only one who might be having a difficult time relating the order in this shot. Yesterday I started to write a less than classy comment to this effect. But today I have a little more perspective even though a hidden voter just left a comment about my entry not meeting the order challenge. It''s all about perspective and how one chooses to perceive things. I''ll deal with him later. For now I am bumping this shot up one point since it so well done and I''ll perceive this shot to mean the "tide" as representing the order since the tide is never late or early.</td>', 'I hope I am not the only one who might be having a difficult time relating the order in this shot. Yesterday I started to write a less than classy comment to this effect. But today I have a little more perspective even though a hidden voter just left a comment about my entry not meeting the order challenge. It''s all about perspective and how one chooses to perceive things. I''ll deal with him later. For now I am bumping this shot up one point since it so well done and I''ll perceive this shot to mean the "tide" as representing the order since the tide is never late or early.', '2010-07-13 17:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
