(6093099, 895714, 10523, '<td valign="top">My first Ribbon!!!  Thank you everyone for the nice votes and comments.  I sincerely appreciate it.  I try really hard to submit something interesting and different for each challenge and feel like the hard work was rewarded. This shot is taken in Canton, Georgia at the Georgia National Military Cemetary and Monument.  It is a very moving place, and I took the shot with my 8 year-old son on the 4th of July weekend to remind him (and myself) in part about the sacrifices our soldiers have made and make every day for our country.  Thank you again...</td>', 'My first Ribbon!!!  Thank you everyone for the nice votes and comments.  I sincerely appreciate it.  I try really hard to submit something interesting and different for each challenge and feel like the hard work was rewarded. This shot is taken in Canton, Georgia at the Georgia National Military Cemetary and Monument.  It is a very moving place, and I took the shot with my 8 year-old son on the 4th of July weekend to remind him (and myself) in part about the sacrifices our soldiers have made and make every day for our country.  Thank you again...', '2010-07-14 19:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
