(6095591, 895729, 117559, '<td valign="top">Spent a while trying to figure out which challenge to enter and what to enter.  Then as I was watching a show called "What went boom in the bust."...they mentioned Scrabble and I thought, "sure, why not!"...so off I went to set it up.  I tried lining the tiles up, I tried tilting the board, I tried different things and finally settled on this one.  <br/>As I took it straight from the camera and submitted it I am very happy with my personal best.<br/> <br/>Thanks for all the good feedback and things to try.</td>', 'Spent a while trying to figure out which challenge to enter and what to enter.  Then as I was watching a show called "What went boom in the bust."...they mentioned Scrabble and I thought, "sure, why not!"...so off I went to set it up.  I tried lining the tiles up, I tried tilting the board, I tried different things and finally settled on this one.  As I took it straight from the camera and submitted it I am very happy with my personal best. Thanks for all the good feedback and things to try.', '2010-07-17 10:56:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(6095791, 896227, 60495, '<td valign="top">Wow, another top, looks like someone is getting the hang of this! Nice shot Tom.</td>', 'Wow, another top, looks like someone is getting the hang of this! Nice shot Tom.', '2010-07-17 18:40:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6096627, 896148, 96572, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the red! Excellent work!</td>', 'Congrats on the red! Excellent work!', '2010-07-19 00:49:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6096632, 896148, 59267, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! congratulations on your ribbon!</td>', 'Beautiful shot! congratulations on your ribbon!', '2010-07-19 00:52:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(6098134, 896199, 43463, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the orderly line of trees lining the pathway; a pathway to the unknown and perhaps some more natural beauty that lies beyond our sight. I''ll have you know that you captured the dappled light shining and sparkling on the tree branches above perfectly. One can just watch the play of light in the leaves of trees to kick back and relax. There are two things I think that could have been done to make this capture even more visually appealing. First is that there is a purplish tone to the tree trunks. A color Adjust of the R G B where you subract some of the red would help to bring down those odd purple/red tones. Next is to play with the overall Shadow/Highlight/Midtones in the image. Just a touch more shadow and a bump in the midtones would improve the contrast and detail definition in the composition and the blades of grass would benefit from this too.</td>', 'I like the composition of the orderly line of trees lining the pathway; a pathway to the unknown and perhaps some more natural beauty that lies beyond our sight. I''ll have you know that you captured the dappled light shining and sparkling on the tree branches above perfectly. One can just watch the play of light in the leaves of trees to kick back and relax. There are two things I think that could have been done to make this capture even more visually appealing. First is that there is a purplish tone to the tree trunks. A color Adjust of the R G B where you subract some of the red would help to bring down those odd purple/red tones. Next is to play with the overall Shadow/Highlight/Midtones in the image. Just a touch more shadow and a bump in the midtones would improve the contrast and detail definition in the composition and the blades of grass would benefit from this too.', '2010-07-20 12:39:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6098491, 896249, 56545, '<td valign="top">I agree with Hawkeye... there was something about this picture that just really grabbed me. Nice work!</td>', 'I agree with Hawkeye... there was something about this picture that just really grabbed me. Nice work!', '2010-07-20 20:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
