(6105611, 896198, 112136, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot...... one of my dream shots :)</td>', 'Beautiful shot...... one of my dream shots :)', '2010-07-27 09:41:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6109790, 896214, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think you did nicely with the duotone.  Depending on what is to the left and right, this may be a shot for a square crop with the reflected horizon splitting the canvas in two.  Right now it feels a little cramped on the left and right.  Clouds, again, might help, but if you have a gradient going (like you do here) they aren''t necessary and only provide a different possible avenue.</td>', 'I think you did nicely with the duotone.  Depending on what is to the left and right, this may be a shot for a square crop with the reflected horizon splitting the canvas in two.  Right now it feels a little cramped on the left and right.  Clouds, again, might help, but if you have a gradient going (like you do here) they aren''t necessary and only provide a different possible avenue.', '2010-07-30 19:12:50.000000', NULL, 0),
